This article lists all gashapon merchandise in [[The Battle Cats]].

==Nyanko Great War! Strap 1==
'''Nyanko Great War! Strap''' was the first campaign of [https://gashapon.jp/nyanko/ Gashapon capsule toys]. It featured many [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] and one [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] as keychain straps.
<gallery position="center" hideaddbutton="true" bordercolor="transparent">
Tit1.png
Gashapon 01.png|A list of all collectible keychain figures
Capsule cat how to get.png|Instructions on how to unlock [[Capsule Cat (Special Cat)|Capsule Cat]]
</gallery>

==Nyanko Great War! Strap 2==
'''Nyanko Great War! Strap 2''' was the second campaign of Gashapon capsule toys. It featured more Normal Cats and three Special Cats as keychain straps.
<gallery position="center" hideaddbutton="true" bordercolor="transparent">
Tit2.png
Gashapon 02.png|A list of all collectible keychain figures
Vending machine cat how to get.png|Instructions on how to unlock [[Toy Machine Cat (Special Cat)|Toy Machine Cat]]
</gallery>

==Nyanko Great War! Strap 3==
'''Nyanko Great War! Strap 3''' was the third campaign of Gashapon capsule toys. It featured [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], three [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]], [[Cat Bros (Special Cat)|Cat Bros]], [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Nekoluga]], and [[Teacher Bun Bun]] as keychain straps.
<gallery position="center" hideaddbutton="true" bordercolor="transparent">
Tit3.png
Gashapon 03.png|A list of all collectible keychain figures
3 brother cat how to get.png|Instructions on how to unlock Cat Bros
</gallery>

==Nyanko Great War! Funyuu Funyuu Mascot!==
'''Nyanko Great War! Funyuu Funyuu Mascot!''' was the fourth campaign of Gashapon capsule toys. It featured many [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]], [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Nekoluga]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] and [[Squish Ball Cat (Special Cat)|Squish Ball Cat]] as squishable keychain straps.
